    <briefdescription>
<para>PLIC-based interrupt controller abstraction for the application. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Wraps the BSP PLIC driver (mcu/software/standalone/driver/plic.h) and the RISC-V trap handling. A single static instance manages the handler vector table; handlers are registered per interrupt ID with <ref refid="interrupt_8h_1a3bd14b5aefa908e4d4a36f872a4ecf4a" kindref="member">intr_connect()</ref> and dispatched by the machine-external trap path. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
